message: "Bu yazılımı kullanırsanız lütfen aşağıdaki künyeyle atıf yapın. If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "mizan"
abstract: >-
  Calculation tool for Turkish legal claims at the level of a court expert
  report, covering employment receivables, enforcement cover accounts, statutory
  attorney fees and matrimonial property regime liquidation. For each item it
  produces a dated PDF report (and UYAP .udf document format output across all four
  calculation domains) showing the inputs, the formula, the statutory basis and
  the source of every official table row used. Phase 1 covers severance, notice
  and bad-faith pay, reinstatement items (idle-period pay and non-reinstatement
  compensation), annual leave (including pre-2003 Law No. 1475 tiers), unpaid
  wages and bonuses, overtime, weekly rest, public holiday pay with calendar
  derivation, 2026 9x social security ceiling, statute of limitations clipping,
  gross-to-net conversion and interest. Phase 2 adds enforcement cover account,
  3095 interest, Law No. 492 and Law No. 2548 fees and Turkish Code of
  Obligations Art. 100 partial payment imputation; Minimum Attorney Fee Tariff
  (AAUT, including 2026-2027); and liquidation of the participation in acquired
  property regime under Turkish Civil Code Arts. 202-241. Legal choices are
  explicit parameters, shared between the CLI and a serverless web interface.
